          %h2#examples Examples
          %h3#free_topological_loop_spaces Free topological loop spaces
          %p
            In
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Top"} Top
            the notion of free loop space objects reproduces the standard notion of topological
            = succeed "s." do
