            %p
              To see better what this is, we pass to an equivalent smaller groupoid (the
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/homotopy+pullback"} homotopy pullback
              is defined, of course, only up to weak equivalence). Notice that every morphism
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
